cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference live-panel, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "live-panel: animated architecture diagrams from one JSON file"
abstract: >-
  live-panel is an open-source agent skill and renderer that turns one JSON
  config into an animated architecture diagram - a terminal-style live panel
  or a light pastel infographic - rendered to an H.264 mp4 or a self-contained
  web page. The motion idea comes from an architecture-diagram clip by
  @thedelost.
authors:
